 "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le17ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn8le17ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "Halloween has arrived. If I were a child again, I would freak out!\nI would be putting on my elegant costume if I were a little girl getting ready to go out. It is so much fun!\nWriting about superstitions was also fun because superstitions are magical and sometimes sacred and I love the stories. I was delighted by your emails. I wanted to make my blog entries as entertaining as possible.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn8le17ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "26500", "text": "I hope to hear from all my fans again for the next mailbag bunch. All of your superstition emails were read, but if I didn't address yours, I am sorry. Providing me topics makes you all a big part of my blog.  Again I'm sure mistakes were made, so please send me your corrections.<br/><br/>\nWhat am I doing tonight?  I am supposed to give out candy, then I am supposed to go to a costume party. I was supposed to go to a friend's house for dinner, but I decided not to go. Late tonight, I am supposed to go dancing. So it will be an exciting evening.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le17ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "59000", "text": "Finally, I wanted to talk about one more thing.<br/>\nA lot of you wrote about superstitions and the curse of bad luck and asked me if it is possible to change your luck.<br/>\nMy advice, if I were you I wouldn't worry about being lucky. Don't be a victim.\nInstead, if I were you, I would try to make my own luck by continuing to work hard.\n<br/><br/>\nHappy Halloween.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn8le17ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le17ob11re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0}]}